{
 "encounter_id": "00938",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um, sorry, I've got these blisters on my chest, and they're very painful. I think it might be shingles, but I'm not sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's have a look at the story. Where are they, exactly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "On the right side of my chest, in a band, round to my back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did you first notice them?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four days ago? Maybe five? I think it started with a tingling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "In the triage notes you said Tuesday, so that's four days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, Tuesday, I suppose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it painful or itchy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Burning, mostly. It's worse at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or feeling unwell?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit achy, but no fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blisters near your eyes, or your face?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Only on the chest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had chickenpox in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "As a child, yes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I don't have any allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I've done his observations. Pulse 78, blood pressure 130 over 82, temperature 36.9, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Let me look at the rash. Please lift your shirt. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course.",
   "pause": 16.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Clusters of blisters on a red base, in a band on the right chest wall, not crossing the middle. That is classic for shingles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it is shingles? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. Because you're within the first few days, I'd like to start an antiviral, aciclovir, 800 mg, five times a day for seven days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five times a day? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, about every four hours while you're awake. And simple painkillers for the pain. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it contagious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "To anyone who hasn't had chickenpox, yes, until the blisters crust over. Please avoid pregnant women, babies and anyone with a weak immune system."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll give you a leaflet on that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week, to check how it's healing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
